      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766506722266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 19888,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766506726866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I can certainly look into that for you. Do you have an order number?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766506728866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. It's 774-B-910.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 19888,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766506733999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. One moment... I see an order for a Trail Helmet. Is that the correct item?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766506735533332
    },
    {
      "text": "Obviously.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 19888,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766506741399998
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright. And just so I can properly document this, what specifically is the issue with the helmet? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766506742266664
    },
    {
      "text": "I just don't like the color. It's not what I thought it would be.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 19888,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766506752266664
    },
    {
      "text": "I see. I understand that aesthetics are important. I do want to assure you that regardless of the color, that particular helmet is one of our top models for rider safety.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766506756799997
    },
    {
