      "user_id": 19888,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766506768333330
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, absolutely. Let me just check the purchase date... Okay, I see it was delivered 43 days ago. Looking at our policy, you are well within the 90-day return window.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766506774133330
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. So what happens now?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 19888,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766506785399996
    },
    {
      "text": "I have just approved the return for you. I'm sending a prepaid shipping label to the email address on file. Just print it out, attach it to the package, and drop it at any post office. Once we receive the item, we'll process a full refund.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
